<h2 id="what-is-code-owned">What is code-owned</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Area</th><th>Contract</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Order verification</td><td>Order number and email or ZIP resolve through the local order book.</td></tr><tr><td>Return decision</td><td><code>AdjudicateStep</code> applies policy and computes a refund without an LLM decision.</td></tr><tr><td>Approval</td><td>A refund over the agent authority limit must have explicit confirmation before it is committed.</td></tr><tr><td>Billing</td><td>The disputed amount is derived from ledger entries before <code>EscalateStep</code> creates the ticket.</td></tr></tbody></table>

